    "updated_at": "2026-10-28T09:04:16Z",
    "body": "another idea. \n\n* `href` is used for the `script` element in SVG because of the history of `xlink:href`. `xlink:href` is being deprecated.\n* I wonder if we could move SVG `script` element to the `src` attribute but as an alias of `href` to take into account sanitizers, and other subtleties. \n",
